  "caveats": [
    "The cache needs --moe-cache-cpu-share 0.95; 1.0 freezes it and loses most of the gain.",
    "q8_0 KV costs 29% decode at 32k depth on this model; keep f16.",
    "If your job runner caps memory and counts page cache, allow about 44 GB.",
    "Smaller expert quants (Q3_K, UD-Q3_K_XL) were slower or too lossy and did not ship."
